    "content": "Here's the Fibonacci function:\n\n```rust\npub fn fibonacci(n: u64) -> u64 {\n    match n {\n        0 => 0,\n        1 => 1,\n        _ => fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2),\n    }\n}\n\n// More efficient iterative version\npub fn fibonacci_iterative(n: u64) -> u64 {\n    if n <= 1 {\n        return n;\n    }\n    \n    let (mut a, mut b) = (0, 1);\n    for _ in 2..=n {\n        let temp = a + b;\n        a = b;\n        b = temp;\n    }\n    b\n}\n```\n\nThe iterative version is much more efficient for large numbers as it runs in O(n) time instead of O(2^n).",
